                <p>Hydraulic troubleshooting, hose replacement, and system maintenance.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
                <h3>Preventive Maintenance</h3>
                <p>Scheduled inspections and servicing to maximize equipment lifespan.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
                <h3>Electrical Diagnostics</h3>
                <p>Advanced diagnostics and repair of electrical and electronic systems.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
                <h3>Undercarriage Repair</h3>
                <p>Track, roller, sprocket, and undercarriage maintenance services.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
                <h3>Field Service</h3>
                <p>On-site repair and emergency breakdown support for your equipment.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
